{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:19794","original":"The protagonist of [[Mahou Shoujo Madoka Magica]]. A kind-hearted girl who attends Mitakihara Middle School, raised by a loving family consisting of mother [[Kaname Junko]], father [[Kaname Tomohisa]], and younger brother [[Kaname Tatsuya]]. She often thinks of herself as ordinary and not special, but starts to consider being able to do more upon meeting the magical messenger [[Kyubey]]. Her birthday is on October 3rd.\r\n\r\nHer [[short hair|short]] [[pink hair]] is tied into [[short twintails|pigtails]]. She also has [[pink eyes]].\r\n\r\nIn her daily life, she typically wears the [[Mitakihara school uniform]] paired with [[white thighhighs|white]] [[thighhighs]] and [[red ribbon|red]] or [[yellow ribbon|yellow]] [[ribbon]]s [[hair ribbon|in her hair]].\r\n\r\nAs a [[Magical Girl]], she wears [[pink bow|pink]] [[hair bow|hair]] [[bow]]s, a [[red choker|red]] [[bow choker]], a [[pink gem|pink]] [[chest jewel]], a [[short dress|short]] [[pink dress|pink]] [[dress]] with a [[square neckline]], [[puffy short sleeves|puffy short]] [[white sleeves]], a [[petticoat]], [[buttons]] and a [[heart cutout]] at the [[back cutout|back]], [[white gloves|white]] [[gloves]], a [[miniskirt|short]] [[white skirt|white]] [[frilled skirt|frilled]] [[bubble skirt]], [[frilled socks|frilled]] [[white socks|white]] [[kneehighs]] and [[red shoes|red]] [[pumps]] with [[footwear_bow|straps]]. She fights using a [[bow (weapon)|]] and [[arrow (projectile)|]]s.\r\n\r\nHer [[voice actor|voice actresses]] are none other than [[Yuuki Aoi]] (Japanese) and [[Christine Marie Cabanos]] (English).\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !asset #49334329: [[Mitakihara school uniform]]\r\n* !asset #49334341: [[Kaname Madoka (magical girl)|Magical Girl]]\r\n* !asset #49334358: [[Ultimate Madoka]]\r\n* !asset #49499755: [[Mahou Shoujo Madoka Magica: Walpurgis No Kaiten]]\r\n* !asset #49333496: [[Kaname Madoka (haregi ver.)|Haregi ver.]]\r\n* !asset #49333525: [[Kaname Madoka (swimsuit costume)|Swimsuit Costume]]\r\n* !asset #49333567: [[Kaname Madoka (swimsuit ver.)|Swimsuit ver.]]\r\n* !post #4379828: [[Kaname Madoka (sexy madoka)|Sexy Madoka]]\r\n* !post #1238687: [[Gomadoka]]\r\n\r\nh4. See also\r\n\r\n* [spoiler][[Kriemhild Gretchen]][/spoiler]\r\n* [[Keep this a secret from everyone in class]] \r\n\r\nh4. External links \r\n\r\n* \"Puella Magi Wiki: Madoka Kaname\":[https://wiki.puella-magi.net/Madoka_Kaname]","response_truncated":false,"search_text_truncated":false,"source_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42","status":"source_backed","title":"kaname_madoka"}],"evidence_chain":[{"evidence_id":"native:592925","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"native_identity","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_id":592925},{"active_alias_ids":[],"coverage":"scoped_complete","evidence_id":"scope:kaname_madoka","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:55.857119+00:00","name":"kaname_madoka","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945.raw","raw_sha256":"4f53cda18c2baa0c0354bb5f9a3ecbe5ed12ab4d8e11ba873c2f11161202b945","role":"canonical_scope","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f"},{"association":"official embedded tag.wiki_page","evidence_id":"wiki:25531","fetched_at_utc":"2026-09-30T06:43:34.899059+00:00","raw_path":"reports/P3/raw/4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8.raw","raw_sha256":"4ccce02e466f4f14ee4a5252b48b72c33b53db57c6b470fe7307e40a3668a7b8","role":"wiki_tag_link","source_id":"danbooru-native-scoped-4ccce02e466f","tag_i